OL,3,ABurnham arrives in Ukraine with plans
OL,4,Ato hand over UK blueprints for
OL,5,Along-range missiles
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is in Ukraine's capital
OL,8,FKyiv for his first foreign visit since
OL,9,Fbecoming UK prime minister - see images
OL,10,Fof his arrival
OL,12,FAs well as chairing his first meeting
OL,13,Fof the "coalition of the willing", the
OL,14,FPM is set to hand over blueprints so
OL,15,FUkraine can build its own long-range
OL,16,Fmissiles
OL,18,FThe visit comes on Ukraine's
OL,19,Findependence day and after Moscow last
OL,20,Fweek warned of "consequences" over the
OL,21,Fuse of British drones by Ukraine
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
