OL,3,ABurnham arrives in Ukraine with plans
OL,4,Ato hand over UK blueprints for
OL,5,Along-range missiles
OL,6,
OL,7,FKyiv has recently stepped up long-range
OL,8,Fattacks on Moscow and other Russian
OL,9,Fregions, targeting oil refineries and
OL,10,Fwarehouses of the country's largest
OL,11,Fonline retailer, Wildberries
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Ukraine and Russia continued
OL,14,Fto fire strikes at each other
OL,15,Fovernight. Two people were killed in
OL,16,Fsouth-west Russia due to falling
OL,17,Fdebris, state news agency Tass reports
OL,19,FRussia's defence ministry says its
OL,20,Fforces attacked port infrastructure and
OL,21,Fvessels in the Odesa region - there's
OL,22,Fbeen no confirmation from Kyiv
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
