OL,3,APCs killed in A66 crash were heroes,
OL,4,Asay families
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers who died when a car
OL,7,Ftravelling the wrong way down a dual
OL,8,Fcarriageway crashed into their vehicle
OL,9,Fhave been hailed as heroes by their
OL,10,Ffamilies.
OL,12,FPC Tom Clough, 38, and PC Matthew
OL,13,FBlades, 37, died when a Volkswagen
OL,14,FPassat, which officers had been
OL,15,Fpursuing until seconds before, collided
OL,16,Fwith their marked armed response car on
OL,17,Fthe A66 near Middlesbrough on Saturday.
OL,19,FThe Passat's occupants - Michael Robert
OL,20,FCahill, 23, Jacob Matusiak, 23, Theo
OL,21,FRae, 17, Makai Saddington, 18, and Cole
OL,22,FRobert Worthy, 17 - also died.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
