OL,3,APubs and hotels could see business
OL,4,Arates reformed after review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review is being launched into the way
OL,7,Fbusiness rates are calculated for pubs
OL,8,Fand hotels in England and Wales, and
OL,9,Fcould lead to a reform of the system.
OL,11,FThe Treasury says business rates expert
OL,12,FJerry Schurder will lead the review
OL,13,Finto rate valuations and report back in
OL,14,FMarch 2027, with the government calling
OL,15,Ffor the views of landlords, hoteliers
OL,16,Fand business owners to feed in to the
OL,17,Fprocess.
OL,19,FLast month, Andy Burnham announced a
OL,20,F20% cut in business rates for pubs,
OL,21,Fsocial clubs and live music venues in
OL,22,FEngland, to come into effect in April.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
