OL,3,AShein aims for almost $27bn valuation
OL,4,Ain stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FFast-fashion giant Shein could see its
OL,7,Fstock market valuation reach almost
OL,8,F$27bn (#19.8bn) when its makes its
OL,9,Fdebut in Hong Kong on 1 September.
OL,11,FThe long-awaited move comes after
OL,12,Ffailed attempts to list in the US and
OL,13,FLondon due to regulatory challenges
OL,14,Famid scrutiny of the firm, which has
OL,15,Fits headquarters in Singapore but was
OL,16,Ffounded in China.
OL,18,FSince it was founded in 2008, Shein has
OL,19,Frisen to become one of the world's
OL,20,Fbiggest fast-fashion retailers, with
OL,21,Fcustomers in more than 150 countries.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
