OL,3,AChina probes use of formaldehyde to
OL,4,Akeep cabbages fresh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities in China have launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation into reports of
OL,8,Fformaldehyde being used to preserve the
OL,9,Ffreshness of cabbages for human
OL,10,Fconsumption.
OL,12,FOfficials in the north-eastern Hebei
OL,13,Fprovince confirmed that they had
OL,14,Fverified footage showing individuals
OL,15,Fdipping cabbages in a solution before
OL,16,Floading them onto trucks for
OL,17,Ftransportation.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
